    mistakes=["Mixing the capture filter (stores less) and the display filter (hides).","Reading only the packet list: expand the details to see the real data.", "Forgetting that HTTPS needs the key log to be readable.", "Capturing on the wrong interface (the VPN is tun0).", "Opening untrusted captures on your main machine: dissectors have had bugs; use the lab VM."],
